OL,3,GNEWSAManslaughter charge after
OL,4,A'altercation' outside bar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmanslaughter following the death of a
OL,8,Fwoman in Skegness.
OL,10,FMinnie Jarret, 21, was injured in an
OL,11,Falleged altercation outside Buster's
OL,12,FBar, Grand Parade, at about 01:00 BST
OL,13,Fon 9 August. She died in hospital on 15
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FRennforde Fletcher, 53, of St Ann's
OL,17,FHill in Nottingham, was charged with
OL,18,Fmanslaughter and appeared at Nottingham
OL,19,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,21,FHe was released on bail and is due to
OL,22,Fattend a plea hearing on 9 September.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
